      "change": "UiTheme is the style pack's theme (the default pack with the game's over it) in the scheme and contrast in effect, in the design tokens' own names: colors, radius, fontSize, lineHeight, tracking, fontWeight, blur and durations, then the settings in effect. palette, space, typeRamp, sizes and durationsMs (old og-ui's derived theme) are removed, with the ThemeColor, TypeStepName, TypeStep and ControlSizes types.",
